DESCRIPTION:With a blend of dreamy acoustic duets\, foot-stomping folk and 
 bluesy murder ballads\, New Zealand-formed and Nashville-based South for W
 inter’s sound is as eclectic as their origins. The award-winning act mel
 ds three-part harmonies\, fingerstyle guitar\, mandolin\, banjo\, cello\, 
 foot percussion\, and more into a genre-bending sound described by America
 n Songwriter as “impeccable”. Between releases\, they have toured rele
 ntlessly\, selling out shows and bringing audiences to their feet around t
 he world.\n\nhttps://acadianacenterforthearts.org/events/south-for-winter/
